# @id: glockenspiel
# @name: Glockenspiel
# @category: instrument
# @description: Physical modal modeling of an orchestral glockenspiel (German bells): free-free high-carbon steel rectangular bar Euler-Bernoulli modes (1.0, 2.7565, 5.404, 8.933), pristine low-damping sustain, brass/hard mallet contact click, and high-frequency air shimmer.

# --- Parameter Definitions ---
def init():
    return {
        "BarDecay": eat.param("BarDecay", 0.5, 6.0, 3.2, step=0.0),
        "BellShimmer": eat.param("BellShimmer", 0.0, 1.5, 0.7, step=0.0),
        "MalletHardness": eat.param("MalletHardness", 0.1, 1.0, 0.75, step=0.0),
        "AirSheen": eat.param("AirSheen", -4.0, 8.0, 3.0, step=0.0),
        "Tone": eat.param("Tone", 1000.0, 20000.0, 16000.0, step=0.0),
    }

